</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 9</span><span class="cl"><span class="nv">$code</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="s1">&#39;&#39;</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">10</span><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">11</span><span class="cl"><span class="k">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;font color=red&gt;&lt;B&gt;This is a very simple challenge and if you solve it I will give you a flag. Good Luck!&lt;/B&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&#34;</span><span class="p">;</span>
